So, when you surround people like this,

00:06:39.522 --> 00:06:42.689
just bein' around certain individuals,

00:06:43.858 --> 00:06:47.052
even bein' around Don King,
bein' around Bob Arum,

00:06:47.052 --> 00:06:48.358
bein' around just different people

00:06:48.358 --> 00:06:49.799
that's been in the game a long time.

00:06:49.799 --> 00:06:52.807
And my bein' their buddies.

00:06:52.807 --> 00:06:55.188
Every time I got a (mumbles),
my bein' their buddies,

00:06:55.188 --> 00:06:58.391
I was more like, it's cool
