00:07:01.698 --> 00:07:02.549
but I need yacht like this.

00:07:02.549 --> 00:07:03.382
- [Snoop] Yeah.

00:07:03.382 --> 00:07:05.130
- It's cool to ride in your jet,
but I want to jet like this.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:05.963
