00:07:29.023 --> 00:07:33.514
- We've had this tradition for
probably seven or eight years

00:07:33.514 --> 00:07:38.387
at the company where every
week, we have a Q and A

00:07:38.387 --> 00:07:41.846
where employees can come
and ask me any question

00:07:41.846 --> 00:07:44.915
that they want about what's
going on and what the direction

00:07:44.915 --> 00:07:47.425
of the company is or questions
or things that they read

00:07:47.425 --> 00:07:49.236
about in the press, or that their friends

00:07:49.236 --> 00:07:53.494
who use the product,
what they're asking them.

00:07:53.494 --> 00:07:56.108
It's been this really
important tradition for us.

00:07:56.108 --> 00:07:57.491
Both, because we really believe

00:07:57.491 --> 00:08:00.075
in openness and communication,
and that's what Facebook

00:08:00.075 --> 00:08:04.436
is all about, but it's also
really important for me

00:08:04.436 --> 00:08:08.234
and for running the company
to be able to get feedback.

00:08:08.234 --> 00:08:11.071
And, to be able to learn
what's on people's minds.

00:08:11.071 --> 00:08:14.825
What our employees and folks who are part

00:08:14.825 --> 00:08:16.935
of our team are thinking about.

00:08:16.935 --> 00:08:20.106
And, a lot of the time
there are good questions

00:08:20.106 --> 00:08:22.842
that people ask that change
the way that we think about

00:08:22.842 --> 00:08:25.719
what we're building and what
we're here to do in the world.

00:08:25.719 --> 00:08:28.392
And, that often make us
go think and reevaluate

00:08:28.392 --> 00:08:32.960
how we should be approaching
different problems.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:35.710
(ethereal music)

00:08:36.938 --> 00:08:39.568
- It's hard changing your life.

00:08:39.568 --> 00:08:43.565
It was hard when just
over three years ago,

00:08:43.565 --> 00:08:46.704
in the Penobscot Building
in Detroit, Michigan,

00:08:46.704 --> 00:08:49.732
where I was operating my
business, and I fell on

00:08:49.732 --> 00:08:53.732
some hard times and I was
sleeping in my office.

00:08:54.785 --> 00:08:57.985
It was hard coming into the
lobby and the security said,

00:08:57.985 --> 00:09:00.783
"Excuse me, Mr. Brown, can
we see you for a moment?"

00:09:00.783 --> 00:09:03.467
And I said yes, and I
walked up to the counter

00:09:03.467 --> 00:09:06.263
and he gave me an envelope and he said,

00:09:06.263 --> 00:09:07.944
"Would you mind reading it here?"

00:09:07.944 --> 00:09:10.019
And I opened the
envelope, and the envelope

00:09:10.019 --> 00:09:12.269
was from management that said,

00:09:12.269 --> 00:09:15.852
"This is an office
tower, it's not a hotel.

00:09:17.281 --> 00:09:20.364
"Please do not sleep in your office."

00:09:21.712 --> 00:09:25.445
And I said, excuse me,
sir, I just work long hours

00:09:25.445 --> 00:09:28.653
in creating my business,
I'm an entrepreneur.

00:09:28.653 --> 00:09:30.937
And right now things are bad for me.

00:09:30.937 --> 00:09:34.354
But they're not going
to be this way always.

00:09:35.679 --> 00:09:38.773
And, I just asked for the
opportunity to continue to operate

00:09:38.773 --> 00:09:42.852
like I'm doing, I'm not
trying to make this my home.

00:09:42.852 --> 00:09:45.209
And, it was hard coming through the lobby

00:09:45.209 --> 00:09:46.369
and sometimes they would laugh,

00:09:46.369 --> 00:09:47.498
"There's the guy talkin' about

00:09:47.498 --> 00:09:49.726
"becoming successful and look at him,

00:09:49.726 --> 00:09:54.551
"he's bathing in the bathroom
upstairs on the 21st floor.

00:09:54.551 --> 00:09:56.410
"He sleeps on the floor.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:10:00.551
"Him and two other dreamers
up there, look at him!"

00:10:00.551 --> 00:10:02.715
It was hard, ladies and gentlemen,

00:10:02.715 --> 00:10:06.309
coming to speak to people
and I was facing financial

00:10:06.309 --> 00:10:08.471
difficulties in my own life.

00:10:08.471 --> 00:10:10.492
I was behind on my bills and my dreams,

00:10:10.492 --> 00:10:13.774
and I'm saying to them,
you can live your dream!

00:10:13.774 --> 00:10:15.822
It was hard, ladies and gentleman,

00:10:15.822 --> 00:10:18.339
it was very difficult to pick myself up

00:10:18.339 --> 00:10:20.917
each day believing that I could do it.

00:10:20.917 --> 00:10:23.325
There were times that I doubted myself.

00:10:23.325 --> 00:10:26.309
I'd say God, why is this happening to me?

00:10:26.309 --> 00:10:29.336
I'm just tryin' to take care
of my children and my mother.

00:10:29.336 --> 00:10:32.844
I'm not tryin' to steal
or rob from anybody.

00:10:32.844 --> 00:10:36.060
Why does this have to happen to me?

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:40.938
It was very hard, and here's
what I want to say to you.

00:10:40.938 --> 00:10:44.613
For those of you that have
experienced some hardships,

00:10:44.613 --> 00:10:46.929
don't give up on your dream.

00:10:46.929 --> 00:10:50.845
No one could've convinced
me by holding on,

00:10:50.845 --> 00:10:53.166
by continuing to push forward,

00:10:53.166 --> 00:10:56.646
by continuing to run toward my dream,

00:10:56.646 --> 00:11:00.229
that one day I would
have my own talk show.

00:11:01.621 --> 00:11:03.153
It's a long shot, ladies and gentlemen,

00:11:03.153 --> 00:11:06.604
from Liberty City in an
abandoned building on a floor,

00:11:06.604 --> 00:11:08.336
never knowing my mother or father.

00:11:08.336 --> 00:11:10.885
It's a long shot being here with you

00:11:10.885 --> 00:11:13.559
today in this dome in Atlanta.

00:11:13.559 --> 00:11:16.441
It's a long shot, no college training,

00:11:16.441 --> 00:11:18.145
labeled uneducable, mentally retarded,

00:11:18.145 --> 00:11:20.814
but I kept running toward my dream!

00:11:20.814 --> 00:11:24.731
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:11:28.063 --> 00:11:29.492
Don't stop!

00:11:29.492 --> 00:11:33.409
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:11:35.047 --> 00:11:36.491
Don't stop!

00:11:36.491 --> 00:11:40.408
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:11:49.928 --> 00:11:52.592
Don't stop running toward your dream!

00:11:52.592 --> 00:11:53.425
(jet flying)

00:11:53.425 --> 00:11:54.475
- Thank you, guys, so much for watching.

00:11:54.475 --> 00:11:55.433
I hope you enjoyed, I'd love to know

00:11:55.433 --> 00:11:57.078
what did you think of this video?

00:11:57.078 --> 00:12:00.116
Rule #7 was my favorite,
but which one was yours?

00:12:00.116 --> 00:12:01.165
Leave it down in the comments.

00:12:01.165 --> 00:12:02.991
Also, did we miss an eight, nine, and ten

00:12:02.991 --> 00:12:04.296
that you want to add to the list?

00:12:04.296 --> 00:12:06.149
Let me know, leave it
down in the comments.

00:12:06.149 --> 00:12:07.662
Thank you, guys, again for watching.

00:12:07.662 --> 00:12:09.349
I believe in you, I hope you continue

00:12:09.349 --> 00:12:13.256
to believe in yourself and
whatever your one word is.

00:12:13.256 --> 00:12:15.744
Much love, I'll see you soon.

00:12:15.744 --> 00:12:16.728
